% Account for both the SM1 and SM4 uniform layout
uniform 0 float4 2.0 3.0 0.0 0.0
uniform 4 float4 3.0 0.0 0.0 0.0
draw quad
probe (0, 0) rgba (6.0, 6.0, 6.0, 6.0)

